 "Training arranges embeddings so that words used in similar ways end up <0>close together</0>, and directions can carry meaning.": "",
 "Classic demo: <0>king − man + woman ≈ queen</0>, because \"male → female\" is roughly a consistent direction.": "",
 "The map here is {#}-D and hand-made for illustration. Real embeddings have thousands of dimensions and are not human-readable.": "",
 "Analogy arithmetic works only approximately and in some models; do not expect it to be exact.": "",
