 "angle m·θ": "",
 "rotation R(m·θ)": "",
 "rotated q, k": "",
 "Query position m": "",
 "Key position n": "",
 "q′·k′ with (m={#}, n={#}) = <0>{#}</0> <1/> <2/><3/>offset m − n = {#}": "",
 "Shift both positions by the same amount — the score does not change:": "",
 "Positions": "",
 "Math: R(mθ)q · R(nθ)k = q · R((n−m)θ)k, because rotation matrices satisfy R(a)ᵀR(b) = R(b−a). Only the offset remains.": "",
